{
  "env": {
    "ENABLE_LSP_TOOL": "1",
    "ENABLE_AUTO_MODE": "1",
    "RUSTUP_AUTO_INSTALL": "0"
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/setup-dev-env.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Monitor|Agent|EnterWorktree",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/usr/bin/python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/git-push-guard.py",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook path-guard --agent-type worker --deny kernel/ --deny uefi-stub/ --deny shared/",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook route-shadow",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "agent",
            "model": "claude-fable-5-1",
            "timeout": 600,
            "prompt": "AIOS Fable plan gate (rule 11, Reviews). The hook input is: $ARGUMENTS\n1. tool_input.plan is the plan and tool_input.planFilePath its file. If the plan's first Markdown heading does not start with `# Plan:`, it is not an AIOS working plan: return ok true.\n2. Count the lines containing `FABLE-PLAN-GATE block` in the file at transcript_path. If there are 2 or more, return ok true: the owner reviews the plan next.\n3. Read the section `## Lens: plan` of .claude/agents/code-reviewer.md in the repository that contains cwd, and apply it to the plan. Read the ADRs and architecture sections the plan cites (docs/project/doc-map.md locates them).\n4. With no must-fix finding, return ok true. Otherwise return ok false with a reason that starts `FABLE-PLAN-GATE block <count + 1>/2:` and lists each must-fix finding: the plan step, the problem, the fix."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook repeat-error",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook route-outcome",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook repeat-error",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook route-outcome",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/aios hook route-outcome",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
